  "main": "\n<section class=\"relative pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-14\">\n\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 md:px-12\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"max-w-4xl font-serif text-[clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4.4rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em]\" style=\"font-weight:300;opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">A considered team.<br><em class=\"italic\">Precision, without compromise.</em></h1>\n\t\t<p class=\"tsc-lede mt-8 max-w-2xl text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">Every clinician at The Schoeman Clinic holds the full four-pillar credential stack: higher training in conventional medicine, hormone therapy, functional medicine and longevity. Your care is never handed off.</p>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n<div>\n<section aria-label=\"Filter specialists\" style=\"position:sticky;top:6rem;z-index:40;background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 94%, transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(28px) saturate(1.25)\">\n\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 md:px-12\">\n\t\t<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-y border-[color:var(--border)] py-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 260ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 260ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">Filter by</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 md:gap-3\" id=\"tsc-team-filters\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-filter group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border px-4 py-2 text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] transition-colors duration-500 active\" data-filter=\"all\" href=\"#\" style=\"border-color:var(--ink);background:var(--ink);color:var(--background)\"><span>All</sp